{
  "name": "Store Reviews",
  "description": "The Monday store review an agent writes from the records above: revenue at risk, which stores slipped and why, which audits are overdue.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "write-review",
      "label": {
        "en": "Write this Monday’s store review",
        "zh-CN": "写本周一的门店周报"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-store-ops` skill in this folder and follow it. Write the store review for last Monday to Sunday from the stores, signals and actions: a one-line headline, revenue at risk, how many stores are on standard, every at-risk store with what is wrong and the action, every store whose audit is overdue, and what changed since last week. Save it as a draft.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-store-ops` Skill，按它的规则做。根据门店、信号和整改措施，写上周一到周日的门店周报：一句话结论、有风险的营收、达标门店数、每家有风险门店的问题和对应措施、巡店逾期的门店、与上周相比的变化。保存为草稿。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "compare-weeks",
      "label": {
        "en": "What got better or worse since last week?",
        "zh-CN": "和上周比哪些变好了、哪些变差了"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-store-ops` skill in this folder and follow it. Compare the two latest reviews and the signals between them: revenue at risk, which stores changed status, how the at-risk count moved, and which actions closed. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-store-ops` Skill，按它的规则做。对比最近两份周报和期间的信号：有风险的营收、哪些门店换了状态、有风险门店数怎么变、哪些整改措施完成了。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
